 "title": "The Power of Being Funny",
 "topic": "communication",
 "summary": "The creator argues that people do not appreciate brutal honesty unless it is delivered with humor. She advises people not to judge those who try to be funny even if they fail, because being funny is a skill that can be developed over time.",
 "key_points": [
  "If you want to insult someone, tell a girl she is out of your league, or tell someone the brutal honesty, be funny about it.",
  "People do not appreciate honesty unless you are funny about it.",
  "Never make fun of a guy who tries to be funny even if he is unfunny, because he is trying and knows the importance of humor in life and dating.",
  "Being funny is like a muscle; one day he will be funny, get the girls, and get the career he wants.",
  "A quiz is linked in the bio to check if you are a people pleaser and if you will have a tough time becoming a funny person."
 ],
 "content": "If you want to insult someone, be funny about it. If you want to ask a girl out who's clearly out of your league, be funny about it. If you want to tell people the brutal honesty, be funny about it. And if you say that no, I'm just very brutally honest, I'm very on the face and I just say it as it is, then you're stupid because people do not appreciate honesty unless you're funny about it and that's the part of communication nobody talks about. So never make fun of a guy who tries to be funny, who's actually very unfunny, but still keeps cracking jokes to look funny in a group setting because at least he's trying. He's that guy who knows the importance of being funny in the world and in the dating world specifically. Instead of judging that guy, be that guy because being funny is also a muscle. One day he will be funny, he will get the girls and the successful career that he wants and you will still be there judging him, so stop doing that. And if you think that you're such a people pleaser that you can never be funny, then take this quiz which is linked in my bio because it'll tell you whether you're a people pleaser and whether you will have a tough time become a funny person, because all it takes is knowing where you are in life and then just working towards it. Text on screen: If you're going to tell people the truth, be funny or they'll kill you. - Billy Wilder.",
